+# The Daily Grind
+
+Use Node.js 22 or newer. `npm start` serves the homepage and signup endpoint on
+port 11222 (override with `PORT`). `npm run build` checks JavaScript syntax;
+there is no compilation step or dependency installation.
+
+Newsletter submissions are POSTed to `/api/newsletter` and appended to
+`data/newsletter.jsonl`. Set `NEWSLETTER_FILE` to use a different persistent
+location. Keep this file private and preserve it across deployments. This
+endpoint collects subscribers; sending newsletters is a separate operation.
+
+Serve the site through this Node server so its Content-Security-Policy response
+header is applied. Scripts, styles, connections, and form submissions are
+restricted to the site's origin; images can also load from
+`https://images.unsplash.com`. Inline scripts, inline styles, embedded frames,
+plugins, and base URL changes are blocked. Referrers are suppressed for photos.
+Only explicitly listed public assets are served, so subscriber files cannot be
+downloaded through the web server.
